(text "Each slot: TPS48100 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 + 10 mOhm (ISCP 30.1k, 7.9 A typ) from\nVBAT_P; TPS2553 45.3k (+5V, 523-638 mA) and 80.6k (+3V3, 291-370 mA). PWR_EN =\nNOT EN_N AND NOT PRESENT_N (74LVC1G02); OUT_EN_N = NOT(PWR_EN AND WD_OK)\n(74LVC1G00). All three switch faults and the card CARD_FAULT_N share\nSLn_FAULT_N." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 500.38 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "946aa2a2-4336-470b-843f-3a48b8a66aa2"))
